  "result": "Perfect! I've successfully implemented the payment tracking system. Here's what was added:\n\n## Summary\n\n**New file: `src/payments.js`**\n- `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })` \u2014 Records a payment on an invoice\n  - Validates invoice is 'issued' or 'partially_paid' (NOT_ISSUED error)\n  - Validates amount is a positive integer in cents (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n  - Prevents overpayment (OVERPAYMENT error)\n  - Creates payments array if missing\n  - Updates status to 'paid' when balance is covered, 'partially_paid' otherwise\n  - Returns ok(newInvoice) with payment added\n\n- `balanceDue(invoice)` \u2014 Calculates remaining balance\n  - Returns invoice total minus sum of all payments\n  - Returns 0 if fully paid\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`**\n- Added `NOT_ISSUED` error code\n- Added `OVERPAYMENT` error code\n\n**New tests: `test/payments.test.js`**\n- 14 comprehensive test cases covering:\n  - Validation (draft rejection, amount validation, overpayment detection)\n  - Status transitions (partially_paid \u2192 paid)\n  - Multiple payment accumulation\n  - Balance due calculations\n  - Immutability\n\n**Updated `HANDOFF.md`**\n- Documented new payment functions\n- Updated invoice structure to include payments array\n- Updated test counts (164 passing tests)\n- Removed payment tracking from unfinished work\n\nAll 164 tests pass successfully \u2713",
